OL,3,APetrol bomber jailed over attack on
OL,4,Afamily home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for more than six
OL,7,Fyears after he threw a petrol bomb at a
OL,8,Fhouse in Rotherham.
OL,10,FSeven people were in the property in
OL,11,FWarwick Street, in Moorgate, at the
OL,12,Ftime of attack in November 2023,
OL,13,Fincluding two children and an
OL,14,F11-month-old baby.
OL,16,FSouth Yorkshire Police said six people
OL,17,Fhad managed to get out of the house
OL,18,Funharmed, while one occupant suffered
OL,19,Fserious leg injuries from having to
OL,20,Fjump out of a window.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
