OL,3,APetrol bomber jailed over attack on
OL,4,Afamily home
OL,5,
OL,6,FJamal Usman, 23, of no fixed abode,
OL,7,Fplead guilty to arson being reckless as
OL,8,Fto whether life is endangered at
OL,9,FSheffield Crown Court on Friday and was
OL,10,Fsentenced to six years and four months.
OL,11,FHe was told he would serve an
OL,12,Fadditional three years on licence after
OL,13,Fbeing released.
